# Mosswood Dreadknight: "When this creature dies, you may cast it from your graveyard as an Adventure until the end of your
# next turn." Bot2 Bolts it on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 has only green mana ({G}{G}{G}), which would pay for the creature but not
# for Dread Whispers' {1}{B}: nothing in the graveyard is offered, so the permission does not cast the creature itself
# (CR 715.3). With a Mox Jet down it casts Dread Whispers from the graveyard (draws a card, loses 1 life); the Adventure
# exiles the card as it resolves (CR 715.4), and from exile Bot1 casts the Dreadknight again.

